<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post8047341467595144554..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Yes, We Live in a Communist Country</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>12</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5061192160757662227</id><published>2013-09-15T16:30:05.014-06:00</published><updated>2013-09-15T16:30:05.014-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I came across this excellent documentary about the...</title><content type='html'>I came across this excellent documentary about the history of  communism. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Jura Lina -- The Jewish Hand in Bolshevism &amp;amp; Communism Not Mentioned at School &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XExtgjl44XE  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;BTW, my first visit to your site. Great job!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/5061192160757662227'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/5061192160757662227'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1379284205014#c5061192160757662227' title=''/><author><name>cyndy</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1702111199"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2013 at 4:30 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5850409866453511631</id><published>2013-08-25T22:52:46.414-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-25T22:52:46.414-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I remember when, growing up in socialist-dominated...</title><content type='html'>I remember when, growing up in socialist-dominated Gary Indiana, other kids used to vehemently declare &amp;quot;Up your nose with a rubber hose!&amp;quot; as a standard rejoiner to some perceived slight or actual insult. While I imagine some probably said it to be &amp;#39;cool&amp;#39;, I also believe that others knew what an act of depraved violence it was.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I perhaps did not know at the time of its origins in the Soviet Union, but later I had come to know that several of the kids I went to school with and who lived in my neighborhood were the children of Soviet agents living here. Since these kids *had* to have been exposed to some of the more brutal aspects of Soviet life from the perspective of the party loyalists and their instructors, I realize now that they WERE aware of the origins of the term and had no moral qualms about it!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Joe McCarthy - godawful statist that he was - was inadvertently correct about the danger and the extent of the internal threat. After all, look at who&amp;#39;s running the country now!! We have seen the enemy and it is us.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/5850409866453511631'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/5850409866453511631'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1377492766414#c5850409866453511631' title=''/><author><name>William Flatt</name><uri>http://minutemanpatriot.homestead.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1804061649"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 25, 2013 at 10:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1680735283443894071</id><published>2013-08-22T07:17:32.767-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-22T07:17:32.767-06:00</updated><title type='text'>WHD, I don&amp;#39;t disagree that our economic system...</title><content type='html'>WHD, I don&amp;#39;t disagree that our economic system is better described as fascist (or &amp;quot;corporate socialist&amp;quot;). The same is true of every communist country, beginning with Soviet Russia&amp;#39;s &amp;quot;New Economic Policy&amp;quot; in the early 1920s. What I&amp;#39;m focusing on is the fact that in our system those who act in the name of the state follow Lenin&amp;#39;s formula of &amp;quot;power without limit, resting directly on force.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/1680735283443894071'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/1680735283443894071'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1377177452767#c1680735283443894071' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='29' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-4MVb4nTxouY/UJ0ryiFr79I/AAAAAAAAIWk/c5YUCAg8xUA/s220/ProfilePic.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 22, 2013 at 7:17 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6835425399368208358</id><published>2013-08-21T22:10:06.991-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-21T22:10:06.991-06:00</updated><title type='text'>WNG,&#xa;&#xa;What you call communism, I call fascism. Lik...</title><content type='html'>WNG,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What you call communism, I call fascism. Like the parties ruling this country, same damn thing, far as I can tell.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Posted this in the forum @ the Doomstead Diner http://www.doomsteaddiner.net/forum/index.php?topic=1737.msg30477;topicseen#msg30477&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;www.doomsteaddiner.org&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;m interested in posting it on our blog, with your permission.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;WHD</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/6835425399368208358'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/6835425399368208358'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1377144606991#c6835425399368208358' title=''/><author><name>William Hunter Duncan</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03659156353754825272</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1572555386"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 21, 2013 at 10:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7975756727411306581</id><published>2013-08-21T12:26:13.332-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-21T12:26:13.332-06:00</updated><title type='text'>shoot anything that crosses your threshold without...</title><content type='html'>shoot anything that crosses your threshold without YOUR permission.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;COPS are traitors and enforcers of a military court system. blind brainwashed fools and tools of tyranny, enemies of freedom.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/7975756727411306581'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/7975756727411306581'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1377109573332#c7975756727411306581' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1780452922"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 21, 2013 at 12:26 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-699534857500935975</id><published>2013-08-21T09:31:02.336-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-21T09:31:02.336-06:00</updated><title type='text'>i could only read a part of this its to disgusting...</title><content type='html'>i could only read a part of this its to disgusting and disturbing and i have read a lot. The people who run the USA have given themselves up to pure evil wickedness in high places. the people of the united states deserve whats coming financially. The good will suffer but god judges nations all together. this is truly disturbing the whole idea and pictures made me want to vomit. is could only read part. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/699534857500935975'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/699534857500935975'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1377099062336#c699534857500935975' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-902055177"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 21, 2013 at 9:31 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-68271881169122088</id><published>2013-08-21T09:29:14.309-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-21T09:29:14.309-06:00</updated><title type='text'>the nexus of dumbed down education, entitlement mi...</title><content type='html'>the nexus of dumbed down education, entitlement mindset, privileges disguised as &amp;#39;rights&amp;#39; and aggressive foreign policies are beginning to yield fruit domestically to those who would be king. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;leviathan today does what it wants, when it wants, how it wants and is cheered on by those who will be its next victims. the rule of law no longer exists.  the rule of man is exalted and, in fact, encouraged by those who will come under its boot heel.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;we, the chumps, taken by the con men, continue, in the main, to support those stealing from and killing us.  what will these same people do when the domestic abuse becomes as bad and as out in the open as it is in the rest of the world?  Likely answer: SUPPORT IT.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;the only good thing in all this is that such asinine idiocy that has risen to the surface cannot be maintained, reality having a way of intruding into fantasy ultimately.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;i await the intrusion of reality with  the consequent bankruptcy that is  coming.  nothing else even remotely gives a hint as to the possibility of change from tyranny back to freedom, but, even then, freedom is not assured.  though never assured, at least bankruptcy will provide the opportunity to change things.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/68271881169122088'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/68271881169122088'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1377098954309#c68271881169122088' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-214812776"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 21, 2013 at 9:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4458925106746034260</id><published>2013-08-21T08:11:36.097-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-21T08:11:36.097-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I agree wholeheatedly with your analysis.  That is...</title><content type='html'>I agree wholeheatedly with your analysis.  That is why I left the USA - combined with the stories of Jewish friends whose German granparents told their parents, &amp;quot;You go on to America, we will be fine.&amp;quot;  Now filmkakers like Poitras have to go to Berlin to work on films exposing the abuses of the USA-Government.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The only think I find wholly inconsistent with reality, is the &amp;quot;Communist&amp;quot; label you give your piece.  I suggest anyone with this perspective visit &amp;quot;Capitalist&amp;quot; Indonesia, which was set up by the same interests who run the USA today.  One could also read about Pinochet&amp;#39;s &amp;quot;Capitalist&amp;quot; Chile.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ironically, Russians are more free, and more prosperous today - by FAR - than Americans - though one would not know it listening to the Transnational-Corporate Propaganda from &amp;quot;left/NPR&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;right/Fox&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;centrist/CNN&amp;quot;.  Note what those mouthpieces all agree on, and Be Afraid of those lies most of all.  None EVER speak of Individual Freedom and Liberty for All People - only what &amp;quot;other people&amp;quot; should rule over us.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/4458925106746034260'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/4458925106746034260'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1377094296097#c4458925106746034260' title=''/><author><name>HAR</name><uri>http://www.humansandresources.org</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1857419608"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 21, 2013 at 8:11 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7660871367894200031</id><published>2013-08-21T08:07:24.042-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-21T08:07:24.042-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I agree wholeheatedly with your analysis.  That is...</title><content type='html'>I agree wholeheatedly with your analysis.  That is why I left the USA - combined with the stories of Jewish friends whose German granparents told their parents, &amp;quot;You go on to America, we will be fine.&amp;quot;  Now filmkakers like Poitras have to go to Berlin to work on films exposing the abuses of the USA-Government.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The only think I find wholly inconsistent with reality, is the &amp;quot;Communist&amp;quot; label you give your piece.  I suggest anyone with this perspective visit &amp;quot;Capitalist&amp;quot; Indonesia, which was set up by the same interests who run the USA today.  One could also read about Pinochet&amp;#39;s &amp;quot;Capitalist&amp;quot; Chile.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ironically, Russians are more free, and more prosperous today - by FAR - than Americans - though one would not know it listening to the Transnational-Corporate Propaganda from &amp;quot;left/NPR&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;right/Fox&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;centrist/CNN&amp;quot;.  Note what those mouthpieces all agree on, and Be Afraid of those lies most of all.  None EVER speak of Individual Freedom and Liberty for All People - only what &amp;quot;other people&amp;quot; should rule over us.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/7660871367894200031'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/7660871367894200031'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1377094044042#c7660871367894200031' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1857419608"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 21, 2013 at 8:07 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2200943544843446590</id><published>2013-08-20T18:28:28.186-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-20T18:28:28.186-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Something tells deep in my mind and soul that the ...</title><content type='html'>Something tells deep in my mind and soul that the so called wars for liberation weren&amp;#39;t for liberation at all but power. is this the behavior of a just nation? no not really seems freedom and peace were merely to make there power play marketable.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/2200943544843446590'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/2200943544843446590'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1377044908186#c2200943544843446590' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1778225530"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 20, 2013 at 6:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7912291148926361053</id><published>2013-08-20T08:12:59.362-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-20T08:12:59.362-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Someone once said, &amp;quot;the problem with anarchy ...</title><content type='html'>Someone once said, &amp;quot;the problem with anarchy is enforcing it.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Likewise, the past 2 centuries of war fought in the name of &amp;quot;liberty&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;has produced an absurd result: The victorious US fedgov now stands &lt;br /&gt;alone as the most powerful and murderous paranoid schizophrenic to &lt;br /&gt;ever rule the world.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/7912291148926361053'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/7912291148926361053'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1377007979362#c7912291148926361053' title=''/><author><name>willb</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1075364918"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 20, 2013 at 8:12 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2498655043242601885</id><published>2013-08-19T15:43:10.020-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-19T15:43:10.020-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,&#xa;&#xa;an excellent and very disturbing piece. You...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;an excellent and very disturbing piece. You&amp;#39;ve given me quite a lot of background reading to catch up on there :-)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;All of the component parts, whether of &amp;quot;international&amp;quot; soviet communism, or national socialist hitlerism are in place both sides of the Atlantic, the compulsory euthanasia of hospital patients in Britain is another example of this slow creep.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In today&amp;#39;s news we had an example of &lt;i&gt;sipenhaft&lt;/i&gt;, the principal of guilt by blood or association, with the clearly false detention under &lt;i&gt;anti terror&lt;/i&gt; powers for 9 hours, of Glen Greenwald&amp;#39;s (British Journalist who&amp;#39;s been covering the NSA leaks) partner as he changed flights in London.&lt;br /&gt;http://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2013/aug/18/david-miranda-detained-uk-nsa  &lt;br /&gt;(H/T Wendy McElroy)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As you clearly point out, once such capabilities precedents and persons are in place, they will be used more and more.  We know from bitter experience that such developments are not made to then be not used.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/2498655043242601885'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8047341467595144554/comments/default/2498655043242601885'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html?showComment=1376948590020#c2498655043242601885' title=''/><author><name>Keith</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/yes-we-live-in-communist-country.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8047341467595144554' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8047341467595144554' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-526418143"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 19, 2013 at 3:43 PM"/></entry></feed>